OL,4,CSinner has surgery on knee           W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GWorld number two Jannik Sinner says  W5
OL,7,Ghe has had "minor surgery" on his    W5
OL,8,Gknee, just seven weeks before        W5
OL,9,GJanuary's Australian Open begins.    W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GThe five-time Grand Slam champion    W5
OL,12,Ghas not played competitively since   W5
OL,13,Gwinning Wimbledon on 12 July.        W5
OL,14,                                      W5
OL,15,GIn a post on Instagram, Sinner said  W5
OL,16,Ghe had undergone surgery to "improve W5
OL,17,Gthe condition of my iliotibial band" W5
OL,18,G- a thick band of tissue that runs   W5
OL,19,Galong the outside of the knee.       W5
